# Pairs with NoPhantomAudit. An absent anchor has no version to compare, so
# the caller treats it as moved and records a removal that matched nothing as
# committed instead of no change.
MODULE: AuditEmptyRemovalCommitted
TARGET: NoPhantomAudit
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a removal of an anchor that never existed is committed
PERTURBS: Finalize

--- FIND
                     [] op[o].changed -> "Committed"
--- REPLACE
                     [] op[o].changed \/ op[o].base = 0 -> "Committed"
--- END
